Z||000009||Smoooooth GT||11-16-2001||11:23 AM||||Cliff,<BR>    Wow.... I hope to meet you some day!!! Thank You SOO much for starting AND maintaining this forum DAILY!!!! I am not really c'puter savy at all!!! I did'nt realize that it had to be maintained on a daily basis. If not for this forum... I WOULD NOT  even have a Fiero!!! I think I'm not alone on that either.... I feel other's would have "folded out" and sold thier Fiero's due to a LACK OF KNOWLEDGE, I think that some people are SCARED or INTIMIDATED by the rear engine!!! But, with the help and loving support that I and other's recieve from this forum... WE have stuck it out and we now have a *special weapon* in all the upgrades that we have learned ONLY becauce OF YOU!!!!! If I or OTHER'S can do to help you with ANYTHING to help keep this Forum up and running, JUST LET US KNOW!!!! <BR>     Thank You Cliff....   <BR>            Greatly Grateful.. Steve<BR>                           Smoooooth GT<BR>                 project name: SMGT1<P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Smooooth_Yellow_sig_3.gif">                  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/texas_1.gif">         <BR>Shaved door handles, sidetrim, exhaust outlet's, etc.... smooooth!!!<p>[This message has been edited by Smoooooth GT (edited 11-16-2001).]||||reg||1
